      ],
      "en": "He also said to his disciples, “There was a certain rich man who had a manager. An accusation was made to him that this man was wasting his possessions.",
      "ko": "또한 제자들에게 이르시되 어떤 부자에게 청지기가 있는데 그가 주인의 소유를 허비한다는 말이 그 주인에게 들린지라",
      "source_text_hash": "c510ca2ab52773b299ea89e05d535616a13f37a28fbde92a1888d738c164a2ec",
      "translation_text_hash": "0442bdb7883669647c17857dafb19759374cfa983c2d1f3a34460fd0b9533a2b",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
