      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LUK",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 10
        }
      ],
      "en": "He who is faithful in a very little is faithful also in much. He who is dishonest in a very little is also dishonest in much.",
      "ko": "지극히 작은 것에 충성된 자는 큰 것에도 충성되고 지극히 작은 것에 불의한 자는 큰 것에도 불의하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "e141e90f3dadf61a73e8b771ede893ea564eee2a998766597eb9512a752b35e9",
      "translation_text_hash": "ac74467609a1c506f94e9f25a8febd1507bad7c264cf2fe14cd77cce69951f71",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "지극히 작은 것에 충성된 자는 큰 것에도 충성되고 지극히 작은 것에 불의한 자는 큰 것에도 불의하니라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "ac74467609a1c506f94e9f25a8febd1507bad7c264cf2fe14cd77cce69951f71"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LUK:16:11",
      "sequence": 25632,
      "chapter_label": "LUK 16",
