      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LUK",
          "chapter": 16,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "If you have not been faithful in that which is another’s, who will give you that which is your own?",
      "ko": "너희가 만일 남의 것에 충성치 아니하면 누가 너희의 것을 너희에게 주겠느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "f35cc17fe7eada684881a286afe9f7f1217d73aae6e22f4399c9412602c58f8c",
      "translation_text_hash": "5ba02dbeceb81375e80614758473c39208f94b124572677c66c4f89e59cdc2f7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
