      "en": "“The law and the prophets were until John. From that time the Good News of God’s Kingdom is preached, and everyone is forcing his way into it.",
      "ko": "율법과 선지자는 요한의 때까지요 그 후부터는 하나님 나라의 복음이 전파되어 사람마다 그리로 침입하느니라",
      "source_text_hash": "fb885277223c173ee5387e653b291ae89ad9d78f0cd7fb9eecd3d2246b2011fb",
      "translation_text_hash": "dec57f0779acfa7313081db8648c5771c0a543ceba896fd8134bf3cf2c8f0daa",
