      "en": "But it is easier for heaven and earth to pass away than for one tiny stroke of a pen in the law to fall.",
      "ko": "그러나 율법의 한 획이 떨어짐보다 천지의 없어짐이 쉬우리라",
      "source_text_hash": "3aca28862d37af848f9854c6878d3b2c66ca10e9ae29ac4b113cfd00e9211982",
      "translation_text_hash": "3e3a486608720550884eaf8b76d1e5b08ceca529d433146cb44a6b88eeaf52d1",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
