      "en": "“Everyone who divorces his wife and marries another commits adultery. He who marries one who is divorced from a husband commits adultery.",
      "ko": "무릇 그 아내를 버리고 다른데 장가드는 자도 간음함이요 무릇 버리운이에게 장가드는 자도 간음함이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "70b4fb47ba340c003c948c61565a256d25f33487d644c4c772945124829a3307",
      "translation_text_hash": "578510a645b98e7b968ae4f198f3a0820526b8e68400cbb49b1d0218da679e09",
