      "en": "“Now there was a certain rich man, and he was clothed in purple and fine linen, living in luxury every day.",
      "ko": "한 부자가 있어 자색 옷과 고운 베옷을 입고 날마다 호화로이 연락하는데",
      "source_text_hash": "562106f23edb052f5629d2af90fc4ad1551be4f8916493720cf07a128d5a92fe",
      "translation_text_hash": "efe9211aaaf9d23769689c22048d93714c5f693c8eba9b6df9e34dbddc7c0205",
