      "en": "and desiring to be fed with the crumbs that fell from the rich man’s table. Yes, even the dogs came and licked his sores.",
      "ko": "부자의 상에서 떨어지는 것으로 배불리려 하매 심지어 개들이 와서 그 헌데를 핥더라",
      "source_text_hash": "c11e592d6005cb33081a16105fab71f7e11b0239cca1a25237c2dec5f1be4822",
      "translation_text_hash": "bfe9a074f1a7701f5ab48a547b47027a0023c137c4b2786d465a1deaefd97523",
