      "en": "The beggar died, and he was carried away by the angels to Abraham’s bosom. The rich man also died and was buried.",
      "ko": "이에 그 거지가 죽어 천사들에게 받들려 아브라함의 품에 들어가고 부자도 죽어 장사되매",
      "source_text_hash": "a2ec553ce3c7bcc22ff3397ca96fe9f775510b6ca289d251d7ad07fca06ad2c6",
      "translation_text_hash": "aba8d0fa9214bd29532c1cdf8331f57eec78a5a05b119922dc7ae848cdb0c878",
